<title>USA: Southern Pacific files secondary stock offer.</title>
<headline>Southern Pacific files secondary stock offer.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southern Pacific Funding Corp filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission on Wednesday for a shelf offering of up to 370,000 common shares.</p>
<p>The company said all of the shares are being sold by Imperial Credit Industries Inc., whose stake in Southern Pacific will be 49.4 percent after the offering.</p>
<p>NatWest Securities Ltd will underwrite the offering, Southern Pacific said.</p>
</text>
